sentences.l:
Fan Chi was driving; the Master told him, saying:
“Mengsun asked me about filial devotion;
I answered, saying, ‘Never go against.’”

Ji Kangzi asked: “To make the people reverent, wholehearted and so encouraged —
how?”
The Master said: “Approach them with gravity — then reverent;
be filial and kind — then wholehearted;
raise the good and teach the unable — then encouraged.”

The Master said: “The Yin based itself on the Xia's rites;
what it took away and added can be known.
The Zhou based itself on the Yin's rites;
what it took away and added can be known.
Whoever may succeed the Zhou —
even a hundred ages hence can be known.”
